1
00:00:03,214 --> 00:00:08,094
Schema changes break reports when the teams downstream never read the email.

2
00:00:08,544 --> 00:00:11,852
This Fabric app draws every data contract as a transit

3
00:00:11,852 --> 00:00:14,854
line, and every consumer team as a station on it.

4
00:00:15,892 --> 00:00:18,877
Each change notice is a train at its producer's

5
00:00:18,877 --> 00:00:21,862
terminal, and it departs on the effective date.

6
00:00:22,312 --> 00:00:26,752
Amber pulses are signals still travelling to teams that have not answered yet.

7
00:00:27,556 --> 00:00:29,916
Lenses repaint the same map.

8
00:00:30,366 --> 00:00:33,610
By change type, breaking changes run red; by

9
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:37,076
departure, the trains count down to their date.

10
00:00:37,885 --> 00:00:40,717
The Today panel ranks what needs attention, and

11
00:00:40,717 --> 00:00:42,525
one click flies the map to it.

12
00:00:42,975 --> 00:00:45,883
This breaking rename departs in five days, and

13
00:00:45,883 --> 00:00:48,475
two stations still show a pending signal.

14
00:00:49,284 --> 00:00:51,920
View as one consumer team, and only the

15
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,624
lines that stop at its station stay lit.

16
00:00:55,809 --> 00:00:59,513
The departures board lists every running service, with a

17
00:00:59,513 --> 00:01:02,489
signal lamp for each team that has to answer.

18
00:01:03,297 --> 00:01:05,573
Now I am the producer, and I need to

19
00:01:05,573 --> 00:01:08,607
hash the email column on the customer dimension.

20
00:01:09,057 --> 00:01:12,887
The preview shows the row exactly as it will appear on the board.

21
00:01:17,700 --> 00:01:21,308
Publishing sets a pending signal at every station on

22
00:01:21,308 --> 00:01:24,500
the line, exactly once, even if it is retried.

23
00:01:25,313 --> 00:01:28,066
In the marketing signal box, Chen cannot take

24
00:01:28,066 --> 00:01:30,513
this change yet and objects with a note.

25
00:01:30,963 --> 00:01:34,473
The service is now held at the signal until the producer responds.

26
00:01:38,952 --> 00:01:41,956
Every consumer shakes hands before the train leaves,

27
00:01:41,956 --> 00:01:43,862
and everyone can see who has not.
